BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:Paramount Pictures
DESCRIPTION:When the body of Army Capt. Elisabeth Campbell is found on a G
 eorgia military base\, two investigators\, Warrant Officers Paul Brenner 
 and Sara Sunhill\, are ordered to solve her murder. What they uncover is 
 anything but clear-cut. Unseemly details emerge about Campbell's life\, l
 eading to allegations of a possible military coverup of her death and the
  involvement of her father\, Lt. Gen. Joseph Campbell.
